zYnc0NG55dGIwQXdLZGJ1dkd6OTA0VXQteThSekpTa2dWTW1zQQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"印度：Netflix 簽署 ho Choi 內容協議"},{"title":"Forget the movie theater, this $230 projector brings Hollywood to your backyard","src":"New York Post","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQcEcxVlNOTXhsM0ZhUXBncUg3ZFpXN1NSc0VIalZsZXVGcWsydWllcmM5elQ0VkdENE82ZHdSc0Z6d09xVWtBUGxUQXdLbmdRVC05R1ZWYy1pWjh1ay1uTy1QeWRrVVpvc3BNeWJRVlRGQUtJMGhyc1MyVG9KTm14VjFTMVZMd0JtTG9MSFJhNHNpQW5sWnN5Vl9fWXlfcHg0NjU4T29SMThIMk9VbTlnVXVNTXJrS3d4VWpXQlhjUmRYdw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"忘掉電影院吧，這款 230 美元的投影機將好萊塢帶到您的後院"},{"title":"SKYD Stock Gets JPMorgan Upgrade: Analyst Sees Skydance Gaining Ground On Netflix, Disney With Warner Bros. Deal","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"摩根大通上調 SKYD 股票評級：分析師認為 Skydance 透過華納兄弟交易將在 Netflix、迪士尼等領域取得進展"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":4},{"name":"財報","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-01-23","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1065280/000106528026000034/nflx-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Netflix, Inc. (\"Netflix\", the \"Company\", \"registrant\", \"we\", or \"us\") is one of the world's leading entertainment services offering TV series, films, games and live programming across a wide variety of genres and languages. Members can play, pause and resume watching as much as they want, anytime, anywhere, and can change their plans at any time.","zh":"Netflix, Inc.（「Netflix」、「公司」、「註冊人」、「我們」）是世界領先的娛樂服務公司之一，提供多種類型和語言的電視劇、電影、遊戲和現場節目。會員可以隨時隨地隨意播放、暫停和繼續觀看，並且可以隨時更改計劃。"},{"en":"Our core strategy is to grow our business globally within the parameters of our operating margin target. We strive to continuously improve our members' experience by offering compelling content that delights them and attracts new members. We aim to offer a range of pricing plans, including our ad-supported subscription plan, to meet a variety of consumer needs. We seek to drive conversation around our content to further enhance member joy, and we are continuously enhancing our user interface to help our members more easily choose content that they will find enjoyable.","zh":"我們的核心策略是在營業利潤率目標的範圍內發展我們的全球業務。我們致力於透過提供令會員滿意並吸引新會員的引人入勝的內容來不斷改善會員的體驗。我們的目標是提供一系列定價計劃，包括廣告支援的訂閱計劃，以滿足各種消費者的需求。我們力求圍繞我們的內容推動對話，以進一步提高會員的快樂，並且我們不斷增強我們的用戶界面，以幫助我們的會員更輕鬆地選擇他們喜歡的內容。"},{"en":"We operate as one operating segment. Our revenues are primarily derived from monthly membership fees for services related to streaming content to our members. See Note 13, Segment and Geographic Information, in the accompanying notes to our consolidated financial statements for further detail.","zh":"我們作為一個營運分部進行營運。我們的收入主要來自與向會員提供串流內容相關的服務的每月會員費。有關更多詳細資訊，請參閱我們合併財務報表附註中的附註 13「分部和地理資訊」。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We operate as one operating segment. Our revenues are primarily derived from monthly membership fees for services related to streaming content to our members. See Note 13, Segment and Geographic Information, in the accompanying notes to our consolidated financial statements for further detail.","zh":"我們作為一個營運分部進行營運。我們的收入主要來自與向會員提供串流內容相關的服務的每月會員費。有關更多詳細資訊，請參閱我們合併財務報表附註中的附註 13「分部和地理資訊」。"},{"en":"The market for entertainment video is intensely competitive and subject to rapid change. We compete with a broad set of activities for consumers' leisure time, including other entertainment video providers, such as linear television, streaming entertainment providers (including those that provide pirated content), video gaming providers, open content platform providers, which provide access to user-generated and professionally produced content, as well as more broadly against other sources of entertainment, such as social media, that our members could choose in their moments of free time. We also compete against entertainment video providers and content producers in obtaining content for our service, both for licensed content and for original content projects.","zh":"娛樂視訊市場競爭激烈且瞬息萬變。我們與消費者休閒時間的一系列廣泛活動進行競爭，包括其他娛樂視訊提供商，例如線性電視、串流媒體娛樂提供商（包括提供盜版內容的提供商）、影片遊戲提供商、開放內容平台提供商（這些提供商提供對用戶生成和專業製作的內容的訪問），以及更廣泛地與我們的會員在空閒時間可以選擇的其他娛樂來源（例如社交媒體）的競爭。我們也與娛樂影片供應商和內容製作商競爭，為我們的服務取得內容，包括授權內容和原創內容項目。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The market for entertainment video is intensely competitive and subject to rapid change. We compete with a broad set of activities for consumers' leisure time, including other entertainment video providers, such as linear television, streaming entertainment providers (including those that provide pirated content), video gaming providers, open content platform providers, which provide access to user-generated and professionally produced content, as well as more broadly against other sources of entertainment, such as social media, that our members could choose in their moments of free time. We also compete against entertainment video providers and content producers in obtaining content for our service, both for licensed content and for original content projects.","zh":"娛樂視訊市場競爭激烈且瞬息萬變。我們與消費者休閒時間的一系列廣泛活動進行競爭，包括其他娛樂視訊提供商，例如線性電視、串流媒體娛樂提供商（包括提供盜版內容的提供商）、影片遊戲提供商、開放內容平台提供商（這些提供商提供對用戶生成和專業製作的內容的訪問），以及更廣泛地與我們的會員在空閒時間可以選擇的其他娛樂來源（例如社交媒體）的競爭。我們也與娛樂影片供應商和內容製作商競爭，為我們的服務取得內容，包括授權內容和原創內容項目。"},{"en":"While consumers may maintain simultaneous relationships with multiple entertainment sources, we strive for consumers to choose us in their moments of free time. We have often referred to this choice as our objective of \"winning moments of truth.\" In attempting to win these moments of truth with our members, we seek to continually improve our service, including both our technology and our content offerings.","zh":"雖然消費者可能同時與多種娛樂來源保持聯繫，但我們努力讓消費者在空閒時間選擇我們。我們經常將這種選擇稱為「贏得關鍵時刻」的目標。為了與我們的會員贏得這些關鍵時刻，我們尋求不斷改進我們的服務，包括我們的技術和內容。"}],"segments":{},"peers":["DIS","AMD","BA","JPM","BABA"]}}